256
00:16:07,540 --> 00:16:08,670
He broke up with Julie.

257
00:16:10,510 --> 00:16:13,260
Well, go hug her, for God's sakes.

258
00:16:14,970 --> 00:16:16,970
- Really?     - Really.

259
00:16:18,260 --> 00:16:20,140
It's always been you, Rach.

260
00:16:20,310 --> 00:16:22,100
Oh, God.

261
00:16:27,520 --> 00:16:28,820
Oh...

262
00:16:30,610 --> 00:16:32,940
Listen, I'm sorry I had to work tonight.

263
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:35,360
Oh, that's okay.

264
00:16:35,610 --> 00:16:38,370
- You're worth the wait.     - Oh.

265
00:16:38,580 --> 00:16:40,790
And I don't just mean tonight.

266
00:16:42,870 --> 00:16:48,290
I never dreamed That I'd meet somebody like you

267
00:16:51,210 --> 00:16:54,760
I never dreamed That I'd lose somebody like you

268
00:16:59,300 --> 00:17:05,390
No, I don't want to fall in love

269
00:17:07,600 --> 00:17:08,980
Oh, God!

270
00:17:09,190 --> 00:17:11,440
Oh. Honey.

271
00:17:11,650 --> 00:17:13,230
Oh, that's okay.

272
00:17:14,320 --> 00:17:17,240
Oh, no, you just rolled over the juice box.

273
00:17:20,490 --> 00:17:23,240
Gunther, please tell me you didn't say anything to Rachel...

274
00:17:23,410 --> 00:17:25,500
...about me and the girl from the copy place.

275
00:17:26,040 --> 00:17:27,420
I'm sorry.

276
00:17:27,670 --> 00:17:29,580
Was I not supposed to?

277
00:17:36,510 --> 00:17:38,090
You're the one who ended it.

278
00:17:38,300 --> 00:17:42,310
Yeah, because I was mad at you. Not because I stopped loving you.

279
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:44,640
You still love me?

280
00:17:45,100 --> 00:17:46,520
No.

281
00:17:48,020 --> 00:17:52,440
What does this mean? What do you...? I mean, do you want to get back together?

282
00:17:52,650 --> 00:17:55,150
No. Maybe.

283
00:17:55,360 --> 00:17:57,610
- I don't... I don't know.     - What?

284
00:17:58,990 --> 00:18:00,870
I just... I feel...

285
00:18:09,750 --> 00:18:14,380
I can't believe I even thought of getting back together with you. We are so over.

286
00:18:16,340 --> 00:18:17,510
Fine by me!

287
00:18:19,300 --> 00:18:22,720
And, hey, just so you know, it's not that common...

288
00:18:22,890 --> 00:18:26,600
...it doesn't happen to every guy, and it is a big deal!

289
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:29,440
I knew it!

290
00:18:40,490 --> 00:18:44,030
JUDY [ON TV]: Rachel's coming up. Doesn't she look pretty, Jack?

291
00:18:45,370 --> 00:18:46,830
Oh, my God.

292
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:49,750
- This is us getting ready for the prom.     - Oh!

293
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:52,000
You know what? We don't have to watch this.

294
00:18:52,210 --> 00:18:53,710
- Yeah, we do.     - Come on.

295
00:18:55,130 --> 00:18:56,300
Get a shot of Monica.

296
00:18:56,460 --> 00:18:58,170
Wait, how do you zoom out?

297
00:18:58,380 --> 00:19:00,510
There she is.

298
00:19:01,970 --> 00:19:04,800
Shut up. The camera adds 10 pounds.

299
00:19:05,010 --> 00:19:07,680
Huh, so how many cameras are actually on you?

300
00:19:08,930 --> 00:19:10,690
Dad, turn it off.

301
00:19:10,890 --> 00:19:12,190
- It is off.     - Yeah.

302
00:19:12,400 --> 00:19:13,940
Right, Ross?

303
00:19:18,610 --> 00:19:20,780
Looking good, Mr. Kotter.

304
00:19:23,120 --> 00:19:27,120
I can't go to my own prom without a date. I can't. It's too late.

305
00:19:27,370 --> 00:19:30,620
If you're not going, then I don't wanna go either.

306
00:19:30,830 --> 00:19:32,830
I have a wonderful idea.

307
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:35,290
You should take Rachel to the prom.

308
00:19:35,500 --> 00:19:37,250
We've seen enough. Let's turn it off.

309
00:19:37,500 --> 00:19:40,550
- I want to see.     - Fine, I'm not going to watch, all right?

310
00:19:40,760 --> 00:19:41,840
Come on, kid. Let's go.

311
00:19:43,010 --> 00:19:44,760
Are you handsome.

312
00:19:45,010 --> 00:19:46,600
Let's show them.

313
00:19:50,770 --> 00:19:53,310
- Okay, Dad.     - Rachel, ready or not.

314
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:55,650
Here comes your knight in shining...

315
00:19:55,810 --> 00:19:56,940
Oh, no.

316
00:19:57,110 --> 00:20:01,900
- Bye. Don't wait up.     - Okay, Chip, let's go.

317
00:20:03,160 --> 00:20:04,820
Oh, dear.

318
00:20:05,030 --> 00:20:06,660
Jack, how do I turn this off?

319
00:20:08,990 --> 00:20:11,040
I can't believe you did that.

320
00:20:11,790 --> 00:20:13,580
Yeah, well...

321
00:20:31,140 --> 00:20:33,430
See? He's her lobster.

322
00:20:42,900 --> 00:20:45,150
No.

323
00:20:45,360 --> 00:20:48,160
- You're really not going?     - Yeah.

324
00:20:48,370 --> 00:20:50,740
It's just going to be too hard.

325
00:20:51,290 --> 00:20:53,370
You know, I mean...

326
00:20:53,620 --> 00:20:55,410
...it's Ross.

327
00:20:56,120 --> 00:20:58,710
How can I watch him get married?

328
00:21:00,090 --> 00:21:03,300
You know? It's just for the best, you know? It is.

329
00:21:03,630 --> 00:21:06,300
Plus somebody's got to stay here with Phoebe.

330
00:21:06,550 --> 00:21:09,300
She's going to be pretty big by then...

331
00:21:09,550 --> 00:21:12,520
...and she'll need someone to help her tie her shoes.

332
00:21:13,350 --> 00:21:15,940
Drive her to the hospital in case she goes into labor.

333
00:21:16,940 --> 00:21:18,480
You don't have a car.

334
00:21:18,730 --> 00:21:21,150
- And your license expired.     - I know.

335
00:21:22,190 --> 00:21:25,610
Yeah. See, there's so much to do, and I have so little time to do it in.

336
00:21:32,290 --> 00:21:33,450
Check this out.

337
00:21:33,660 --> 00:21:37,120
It says there's a place you can go to rent videos of all the museums.

338
00:21:37,370 --> 00:21:40,210
"It's almost as good as being there."

339
00:21:40,420 --> 00:21:44,130
It's better. You can't go to a museum in your underwear.

340
00:21:45,220 --> 00:21:47,550
Well, you could, but probably just the one time.

341
00:21:49,640 --> 00:21:51,800
I bet we could get videos of all the sights...

342
00:21:52,010 --> 00:21:55,600
...get a VCR in our hotel room, we'd never even have to go outside.

343
00:21:56,180 --> 00:21:58,190
If we do that, we've got to rent Die Hard.

344
00:22:00,020 --> 00:22:03,070
Flight number 457 from Beijing now arriving.

